`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.li,{children:[(0,n.jsx)(r.strong,{children:"Setup and use"}),": a Primary Owner or Owner sets it up, adds it to a first set of channels, and connects it to the tools, data, and codebases they choose; members can then add Claude to other channels and tag Claude there to delegate tasks while they focus on other work, and Claude builds context from the channels it’s in."]}),`
